---
// Section: Brand Statement & Philosophy (Cinematic Stage Atmosphere & Kinetic Manifesto)
---

<section id="about" class="relative w-full py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[#FAF7F9] dark:bg-void-black border-t border-neutral-200/80 dark:border-white/[0.06] overflow-hidden transition-colors duration-300">
  
  <!-- Subtle Background Diagonal Speed Lines -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20">
    <div class="w-full h-full" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 0, rgba(209,77,145,0.05) 1px, transparent 0, transparent 40px);"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Hero Panoramic Canvas with Integrated Concert Stage Visual -->
    <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-neutral-950 dark:bg-dark-plum border border-neutral-800 dark:border-white/15 p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-20 shadow-2xl dark:shadow-[0_0_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.9)]">
      
      <!-- Real Concert Atmosphere Background Image (Crowd, Stage Lights, Smoke) -->
      <img 
        src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470225620780-dba8ba36b745?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80" 
        alt="Concert Stage Atmosphere" 
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-[0.22] contrast-125 saturate-150 pointer-events-none select-none"
        loading="lazy"
      />
      
      <!-- Gradient Stage Vignette (Void Black + Deep Magenta) -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0B090B] via-[#0B090B]/80 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#0B090B] via-[#0B090B]/60 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-electric-magenta/20 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

      <!-- Content Layer -->
      <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl">
        
        <!-- Top Signal Tag -->
        <div data-animate="reveal" class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-electric-magenta/20 text-electric-magenta border border-electric-magenta/40">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta animate-ping"></span>
            AFTERGLOW PHILOSOPHY
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 dark:text-muted-gray tracking-wider">// THE BASS NEVER DIES</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Huge Bold Headline -->
        <h2 
          data-animate="reveal" 
          class="delay-100 font-display text-5xl sm:text-7xl lg:text-9xl text-white tracking-wide leading-[0.92] mb-8"
        >
          WHEN THE LIGHTS FADE, <br />
          <span class="text-electric-magenta">THE ROAR REMAINS.</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Manifesto Lead Story (Authentic concert emotion) -->
        <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-200 space-y-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#F8F0F5]/90 leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl">
          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-white font-medium">
            <strong class="text-electric-magenta font-bold">AFTERGLOW</strong> lahir langsung dari barisan depan panggung konser — dari suara yang habis karena sing-along bersama 50.000 orang dan getaran sub-bass yang menembus dada.
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-neutral-300 dark:text-muted-gray leading-relaxed">
            Kami menolak ekosistem calo tiket liar, bot borongan, dan antrean palsu yang merusak momen tersebut. Setiap tiket di AFTERGLOW dijamin 100% resmi langsung dari promotor, diamankan dengan teknologi atomik tercepat, dan siap Anda bawa hingga ke depan panggung.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Connected Stage Milestones (Integrated, NO floating boxes) -->
        <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-300 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-10 mt-10 border-t border-white/15">
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-electric-magenta tracking-wide block">100% PROMOTOR DIRECT</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 dark:text-muted-gray font-mono leading-relaxed">
              Alokasi resmi tanpa perantara calo & tanpa markup fiktif.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-wide block">0ms RACE CONDITION</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 dark:text-muted-gray font-mono leading-relaxed">
              Bun + Redis atomik menjamin war tiket adil tanpa server down.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-electric-magenta tracking-wide block">0.3s TURNSTILE TAP</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-neutral-300 dark:text-muted-gray font-mono leading-relaxed">
              Dynamic rotating QR pass anti-screenshot langsung di gate.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA & Stage Details -->
        <div data-animate="reveal" class="delay-300 pt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
          <a 
            href="/events" 
            class="group inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta hover:bg-electric-magenta/90 text-white font-semibold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(209,77,145,0.4)] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95"
          >
            <span>EXPLORE OUR FREQUENCIES</span>
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 transform group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
            </svg>
          </a>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400 dark:text-muted-gray">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400 font-semibold">
              <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
              LIVE PLATFORM VERIFIED
            </span>
            <span>•</span>
            <span>JAKARTA • BANDUNG • BALI</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Right Side Live Stage Audio Watermark (Desktop) -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex absolute right-12 bottom-12 flex-col items-end text-right font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400 dark:text-muted-gray pointer-events-none select-none">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1.5">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-electric-magenta animate-ping"></span>
          <span class="text-white font-bold tracking-wider">STAGE DECIBEL: 118 dB</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-[10px] text-neutral-400 dark:text-muted-gray tracking-wide">35Hz SUB-BASS // 20kHz AIR RESONANCE</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
